{"key":"enterprise/T1204.001","id":"T1204.001","name":"Malicious Link","domain":"enterprise","level":"subtechnique","parent_id":"T1204","tactics":["execution"],"platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"environments":["cloud-hosted-endpoint","onprem"],"environment_basis":"project_taxonomy_from_upstream_platforms","summary":"An adversary may rely upon a user clicking a malicious link in order to gain execution. Users may be subjected to social engineering to get them to click on a link that will lead to code execution. This user action will typically be observed as follow-on behavior from Spearphishing Link. Clicking on a link may also lead to other execution techniques such as exploitation of a browser or application vulnerability via Exploitation for Client…","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/001","source_stix_id":"attack-pattern--ef67e13e-5598-4adc-bdb2-998225874fa9","source_modified":"2026-05-12T15:12:00.723Z","source_object_version":"1.2","telemetry":{"status":"mapped","components":[{"id":"DC0039","name":"File Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0039","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--2b3bfe19-d59a-460d-93bb-2f546adc2d2c","page":"telemetry/DC0039/"},{"id":"DC0082","name":"Network Connection Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0082","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--181a9f8c-c780-4f1f-91a8-edb770e904ba","page":"telemetry/DC0082/"},{"id":"DC0085","name":"Network Traffic Content","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0085","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3772e279-27d6-477a-9fe3-c6beb363594c","page":"telemetry/DC0085/"},{"id":"DC0032","name":"Process Creation","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/datacomponents/DC0032","stix_id":"x-mitre-data-component--3d20385b-24ef-40e1-9f56-f39750379077","page":"telemetry/DC0032/"}],"strategies":[{"id":"DET0066","name":"User Execution – Malicious Link (click → suspicious egress → download/write → follow-on activity)","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detec